# Titan 2: PMIC buttons. 116 is power (as in Generic.kl), 249 is the Func1 programmable side
# key (firmware label: FUNC1, verified with getevent 2026-10-18), 250 is declared on this device but
# arrives from gpio_key-func. MACRO_1/2 are codes free in A16 for our key handler.
key 116   POWER
key 249   MACRO_1
key 250   MACRO_2
